      "refersTo": "shutter",
      "description": "对应 Shutter Canvas 的 84dp View、2dp 环线及内圆间隔；横屏 View 为 74dp。此标本没有相机命令或模拟曝光。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-remote-shutter-ground\"><button class=\"ds-remote-shutter\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"拍照\"></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-remote-shutter-ground{display:inline-flex;padding:12px;background:#121313}.ds-remote-shutter{position:relative;display:block;width:84px;height:84px;padding:0;border:0;border-radius:50%;background:transparent;color:#F3B493;cursor:pointer}.ds-remote-shutter::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:1px;border:2px solid currentColor;border-radius:50%}.ds-remote-shutter::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:9px;border-radius:50%;background:currentColor}.ds-remote-shutter:hover{filter:brightness(1.03)}.ds-remote-shutter:active::after{box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 2px #352016}.ds-remote-shutter:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #F6F1EB;outline-offset:-6px}.ds-remote-shutter:disabled{opacity:.4117647059;cursor:default}.ds-remote-shutter.ds-landscape{width:74px;height:74px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "拍后传入开关 · 文档预览",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "对应现有 Android Switch 的关闭状态与 48dp 行；36dp 是源码的 switchMinWidth。轨道和 thumb 的 CSS 几何仅为平台控件的文档近似，生产大小与交互由 Android 绘制。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-remote-switch-ground\"><button class=\"ds-remote-switch\" type=\"button\" role=\"switch\" aria-checked=\"false\"><span>拍后传入 App</span><span class=\"ds-remote-switch-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ds-remote-switch-thumb\"></span></span></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-remote-switch-ground{display:inline-flex;padding:8px 16px;background:#121313}.ds-remote-switch{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;min-height:48px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;color:#F6F1EB;font:400 10px sans-serif;cursor:pointer}.ds-remote-switch-track{position:relative;display:inline-block;width:36px;height:16px;border-radius:10px;background:#66645F}.ds-remote-switch-thumb{position:absolute;width:20px;height:20px;left:0;top:-2px;border-radius:50%;background:#CBC7BF}.ds-remote-switch[aria-checked=true] .ds-remote-switch-track{background:#A36B4C}.ds-remote-switch[aria-checked=true] .ds-remote-switch-thumb{left:16px;background:#F3B493}.ds-remote-switch:hover,.ds-remote-switch:active{background:rgba(243,180,147,.1490196078)}.ds-remote-switch:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #F6F1EB;outline-offset:2px}.ds-remote-switch:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:default}"
    },
    {
      "name": "只读当前参数 · 文档预览",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "reading",
      "description": "对应真实四个只读字段；用源码的未知值“—”展示，未发明相机参数、输入框或可编辑动作。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-remote-readings\"><div class=\"ds-remote-reading\"><strong>—</strong><span>快门</span></div><div class=\"ds-remote-reading\"><strong>—</strong><span>光圈</span></div><div class=\"ds-remote-reading\"><strong>—</strong><span>ISO</span></div><div class=\"ds-remote-reading\"><strong>—</strong><span>曝光补偿</span></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-remote-readings{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(52px,1fr));padding:7px 10px;background:#121313;border-bottom:1px solid #343535;gap:0}.ds-remote-reading{text-align:center}.ds-remote-reading strong{display:block;font:500 20px sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:#F6F1EB}.ds-remote-reading span{display:block;padding-top:3px;font:400 11px sans-serif;color:#BEB9B2}.ds-remote-readings.ds-landscape{width:197px;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));row-gap:14px}.ds-landscape .ds-remote-reading strong{font-size:18px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "等待取景的小直方图 · 文档预览",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "histogram",
      "description": "对应 Chart(false) 在 frame 为空时的真实等待状态：190×64dp、9dp 圆角，无伪造曲线或实时数据。拖动、统计与暂停仍以原生实现为准。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-remote-histogram\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"取景直方图，点按放大，拖动调整位置\"><span>等待取景</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-remote-histogram{position:relative;display:block;width:190px;height:64px;padding:0;border:0;border-radius:9px;background:#191A18;text-align:left;color:#BEB9B2;cursor:pointer}.ds-remote-histogram span{position:absolute;left:9px;top:5px;font:400 9px sans-serif}.ds-remote-histogram:hover{outline:1px solid #343535}.ds-remote-histogram:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #F6F1EB;outline-offset:2px}.ds-remote-histogram:active{cursor:grabbing}"
    },
    {
      "name": "原生只读参数 sheet · 文档预览",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "sheet",
      "description": "节选现有参数 sheet 的标题、关闭目标、只读说明与两行现有字段。原生 Dialog 的底部／右侧位置、ScrollView、窗口和系统返回不由这个 HTML 标本实现。",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-remote-sheet\" aria-label=\"机身当前参数\"><div class=\"ds-remote-sheet-heading\"><strong>机身当前参数</strong><button class=\"ds-remote-sheet-close\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"关闭\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 6 12 12 M18 6 6 18\"/></svg></button></div><p class=\"ds-remote-sheet-note\">参数只读，请在相机上调整。未提供的项目显示 —。</p><div class=\"ds-remote-sheet-detail\"><span>机型</span><span>—</span></div><div class=\"ds-remote-sheet-detail\"><span>拍摄模式</span><span>—</span></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-remote-sheet{width:280px;padding:14px 20px 20px;border-radius:24px;background:#272625;color:#F6F1EB;font-family:sans-serif}.ds-remote-sheet-heading{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.ds-remote-sheet-heading strong{font-size:17px;font-weight:500}.ds-remote-sheet-close{width:48px;height:48px;padding:13px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:transparent;color:#F6F1EB;cursor:pointer}.ds-remote-sheet-close svg{display:block;width:22px;height:22px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.7;stroke-linecap:round}.ds-remote-sheet-close:hover,.ds-remote-sheet-close:active{background:rgba(243,180,147,.1490196078)}.ds-remote-sheet-close:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #F6F1EB}.ds-remote-sheet-note{margin:0;padding:10px 0 14px;font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:#BEB9B2}.ds-remote-sheet-detail{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #343535;font-size:13px}.ds-remote-sheet-detail span:first-child{color:#BEB9B2}"
    },
    {
      "name": "遥控拍摄标题栏 · 文档预览",
      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "对应 48dp 原生上下文栏的返回、标题与拍摄设置；图标转写原生 AppIcon，不新增目的地。系统 Back、WindowInsets 与 Activity 生命周期仍由原生代码提供。",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-remote-appbar\" aria-label=\"遥控拍摄\"><button class=\"ds-remote-appbar-icon\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"返回同步\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 4 6 12l8 8 M6 12h16\"/></svg></button><strong>遥控拍摄</strong><button class=\"ds-remote-appbar-icon\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"拍摄设置\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"5\" r=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"19\" r=\"1\"/></svg></button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-remote-appbar{display:flex;align-items:center;min-width:280px;height:48px;padding:0 8px;background:#121313;color:#F6F1EB;font-family:sans-serif}.ds-remote-appbar strong{flex:1;font-size:17px;font-weight:500}.ds-remote-appbar-icon{width:48px;height:48px;padding:13px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:transparent;color:#F6F1EB;cursor:pointer}.ds-remote-appbar-icon svg{display:block;width:22px;height:22px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.7;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.ds-remote-appbar-icon:hover,.ds-remote-appbar-icon:active{background:rgba(243,180,147,.1490196078)}.ds-remote-appbar-icon:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #F6F1EB}.ds-remote-appbar.ds-landscape strong{font-size:15px}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "橙光进入照片",
    "overview": "这是 Huevia 既有原生世界在遥控拍摄表面的局部记录：近黑工作区承托完整画面，小机型和小图标退到画面周围，桃色集中标记主快门与选中状态。它继承用户批准的[原型实施约定](../../design-review/remote-capture-20261024/IMPLEMENTATION-CONTRACT.md)，不另设视觉方向。全局品牌与其他表面仍见根 [DESIGN.md](../../../DESIGN.md) 和 [PRODUCT.md](../../../PRODUCT.md)。\n\n规范以 [RemoteCaptureView](../../../app/src/main/java/cc/huevia/ui/RemoteCaptureView.java)、[Activity](../../../app/src/main/java/cc/huevia/RemoteCaptureActivity.java) 和 [Controller](../../../app/src/main/java/cc/huevia/remote/RemoteCaptureController.java) 的实际代码为准；原型 HTML／CSS／JS 是批准的设计来源，生产界面没有 WebView。当前是原生 Material 无 ActionBar Activity、Android Views 与 Canvas；不据平台指南补写代码尚未提供的主题、动效或组件。\n\n本文对应 95／0.20.0-beta，APK SHA-256 为 `cb4d685bfdc9ddae3663b84e0836d45a5b61085ce55967f8f1fa4f81c39e3012`，身份见 [FINAL-IDENTITY](FINAL-IDENTITY.json) 与 [CANDIDATE-IDENTITY](CANDIDATE-IDENTITY.json)。[UI-MATRIX](UI-MATRIX.json) 记录自有 Pixel_9 模拟器和合成 PTP/IP 夹具的 372 次配置检查、49 张原生截图；不是独立场景数或真实相机证据。[完整初审](FINISH-REVIEW.md)的 `disposition: fix` 保留；[后续 verdict](FIX-VERDICT.md) 仅判 M1–M4 resolved、remaining clear、`disposition: ship`，不构成全表面重新认证或用户最终视觉接受。本文件只碳化已落地设计，没有新增运行、设备或视觉审核结论。",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "完整比例取景、近黑仪表材料与紧凑的机型／工具。",
      "四个只读读数围绕单一桃色双环快门组织。",
      "可移动、收起和放大的同帧直方图；旧帧明确暂停。",
      "原生 sp 字号、安全区、系统返回与至少 48dp 操作目标。",
      "竖屏上下布局，横屏左图与可滚动右侧控制区。",
      "拒绝、中断、离线和未知拍摄结果分别给出真实状态。"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The State Color Rule",
        "body": "选中工具必须实际绘成桃色，未选中工具保留中性文字色；关闭的 Switch thumb 使用中性颜色。颜色不能替代状态文字和禁用语义。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Read-Only Instrument Rule",
        "body": "数字是当前相机属性的读数，不是可编辑字段；未提供的项目显示“—”，不以照片 EXIF 或示例参数填充。",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Whole Frame Rule",
        "body": "让完整画面与主快门先被看见；不要为填满容器而改变取景比例，也不要放大机型或可见图标来填空。",
        "section": "layout"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** 以批准的局部原型和实际原生代码延续近黑、桃色、紧凑机型与小图标。",
      "**Do** 保留完整比例画面、48dp 操作目标、sp 字号、WindowInsets、系统返回和可滚动 sheet。",
      "**Do** 让显示帧与统计同源，并明确区分等待、实时、暂停和断线。",
      "**Do** 让只读参数、相机保存、传入 App 和未知拍摄结果各自反映真实状态。",
      "**Do** 将本地模拟器／合成夹具证据与真实 Nikon 相机联调分别记录，保留初审和后续有界 verdict。"
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** 裁切或拉伸取景来消除留黑，或用大机型文字和大图标填满工作区。",
      "**Don't** 将参数读数变成设置控件，或以 EXIF、样例参数和文档预览冒充当前相机数据。",
      "**Don't** 把旧直方图当作实时分布、把预览统计称为 RAW 数据，或在未知结果后自动重发快门。",
      "**Don't** 在未传入 JPEG 的离线状态提供无解释的可用传入动作，或让轮询立即抹去拒绝原因。",
      "**Don't** 把文档性 HTML／CSS 组件预览当成生产实现、原生截图、实机验证或全表面认证。"
    ]
  }
}
